{"id":"04a627c696a1daf7","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-set11-union-closure-hull.md","title":"ZFC Set11 Union Closure Hull","display":"df-zfc-set11-union-closure-hull — ZFC Set11 Union Closure Hull","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set11-union-closure-hull","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set11-union-closure-hull"],"display":"df-zfc-set11-union-closure-hull — ZFC Set11 Union Closure Hull","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set11-union-closure-hull"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set11-union-closure-hull</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set11-union-closure-hull — ZFC Set11 Union Closure Hull"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,A\\in V\">\\(H,A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11UnionClosureHull}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet11UnionClosureHull}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}union\\text{-}closure\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet11UnionClosureHull}_S(H,A)\\leftrightarrow H=\\bigcap\\left\\{K\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\bigcup A)):A\\subseteq K\\land \\forall u,v\\in K\\;(u\\cup v\\in K)\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}union\\text{-}closure\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet11UnionClosureHull}_S(H,A)\\leftrightarrow H=\\bigcap\\left\\{K\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\bigcup A)):A\\subseteq K\\land \\forall u,v\\in K\\;(u\\cup v\\in K)\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every member of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is a subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup A\">\\(\\bigcup A\\)</span>, so the intersected family is correctly bounded by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\bigcup A))\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\bigcup A))\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet11UnionClosureHull}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set11\\text{-}union\\text{-}closure\\text{-}hull} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet11UnionClosureHull}_S(H,A)\\leftrightarrow H=\\bigcap\\left\\{K\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\bigcup A)):A\\subseteq K\\land \\forall u,v\\in K\\;(u\\cup v\\in K)\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\bigcup A))","display":false}],"bytes":877,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3421","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-set11-union-closure-hull.md|58-df-zfc-set11-union-closure-hull]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3"]}